        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam linetype ortho\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam padding 10\nskinparam nodesep 25\nskinparam ranksep 50\nskinparam roundcorner 12\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam ArrowColor #455A64\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1.5\n\n&#39; BẢNG MÀU HIỆN ĐẠI (PASTEL)\nskinparam component {\n    BackgroundColor&lt;&lt;App&gt;&gt; #E3F2FD\n    BorderColor&lt;&lt;App&gt;&gt; #2196F3\n    FontColor&lt;&lt;App&gt;&gt; #0D47A1\n    \n    BackgroundColor&lt;&lt;MCU&gt;&gt; #FFF3E0\n    BorderColor&lt;&lt;MCU&gt;&gt; #FF9800\n    FontColor&lt;&lt;MCU&gt;&gt; #E65100\n    \n    BackgroundColor&lt;&lt;Sensor&gt;&gt; #E8F5E9\n    BorderColor&lt;&lt;Sensor&gt;&gt; #4CAF50\n    FontColor&lt;&lt;Sensor&gt;&gt; #1B5E20\n    \n    BackgroundColor&lt;&lt;Actuator&gt;&gt; #FCE4EC\n    BorderColor&lt;&lt;Actuator&gt;&gt; #E91E63\n    FontColor&lt;&lt;Actuator&gt;&gt; #880E4F\n}\n\nskinparam database {\n    BackgroundColor #F3E5F5\n    BorderColor #9C27B0\n    FontColor #4A148C\n}\n\nskinparam actor {\n    BackgroundColor #F5F5F5\n    BorderColor #607D8B\n    FontColor #37474F\n}\n\nskinparam package {\n    BackgroundColor #FAFAFA\n    BorderColor #CFD8DC\n    FontColor #263238\n    FontStyle bold\n}\n\n&#39; LỚP GIAO TIẾP &amp; ĐIỀU KHIỂN (Xếp dọc ở trung tâm)\nactor \&quot;Người dùng\&quot; as User\ncomponent \&quot;Giao diện Web\\n(Next.js)\&quot; &lt;&lt;App&gt;&gt; as Web\ndatabase \&quot;Firebase\\nRealtime Database\&quot; as DB\ncomponent \&quot;Bộ Điều khiển Trung tâm\\n(ESP8266 NodeMCU)\&quot; &lt;&lt;MCU&gt;&gt; as ESP\n\nUser -down-&gt; Web : Tương tác (Web/Mobile)\nWeb -down-&gt; DB : Đồng bộ (HTTP/Websocket)\nDB -down-&gt; ESP : Truyền nhận (Wi-Fi)\n\n&#39; CÁC TẦNG THIẾT BỊ NGOẠI VI BÊN DƯỚI\npackage \&quot;Tầng 1: An ninh &amp; Giám sát\&quot; as T1 {\n    component \&quot;Cảm biến Hồng ngoại\&quot; &lt;&lt;Sensor&gt;&gt; as IR\n    component \&quot;Cảm biến Nhiệt/Ẩm\&quot; &lt;&lt;Sensor&gt;&gt; as DHT11\n    component \&quot;Bàn phím 4x4\&quot; &lt;&lt;Sensor&gt;&gt; as Keypad\n    component \&quot;Còi &amp; LCD 16x2\&quot; &lt;&lt;Actuator&gt;&gt; as Out1\n    component \&quot;Động cơ Cửa\&quot; &lt;&lt;Actuator&gt;&gt; as Door\n}\n\npackage \&quot;Tầng 2: Báo cháy &amp; Sinh hoạt\&quot; as T2 {\n    component \&quot;Khí gas/Khói (MQ-2)\&quot; &lt;&lt;Sensor&gt;&gt; as MQ2\n    component \&quot;Còi cháy &amp; Đèn LED\&quot; &lt;&lt;Actuator&gt;&gt; as Out2\n}\n\npackage \&quot;Tầng 3 &amp; Thang máy\&quot; as T3 {\n    component \&quot;Cảm biến Vân tay\&quot; &lt;&lt;Sensor&gt;&gt; as Finger\n    component \&quot;Khóa cửa T3\&quot; &lt;&lt;Actuator&gt;&gt; as Out3\n    \n    component \&quot;Bộ ĐK Thang máy\\n(Arduino UNO)\&quot; &lt;&lt;MCU&gt;&gt; as Ard\n    component \&quot;Nút gọi &amp; Hành trình\&quot; &lt;&lt;Sensor&gt;&gt; as ElevSen\n    component \&quot;Động cơ (L298N)\&quot; &lt;&lt;Actuator&gt;&gt; as ElevMotor\n}\n\n&#39; Dàn đều các khối ngang nhau để không bị lệch\nT1 -[hidden]right-&gt; T2\nT2 -[hidden]right-&gt; T3\n\n&#39; ĐIỀU HƯỚNG MŨI TÊN (Giúp đường thẳng tắp, không đứt đoạn)\n&#39; Tầng 1\nIR -up-&gt; ESP\nDHT11 -up-&gt; ESP\nKeypad -up-&gt; ESP\nESP -down-&gt; Out1\nESP -down-&gt; Door\n\n&#39; Tầng 2\nMQ2 -up-&gt; ESP\nESP -down-&gt; Out2\n\n&#39; Tầng 3\nFinger -up-&gt; ESP\nESP -down-&gt; Out3\n\n&#39; Nội bộ hệ thống thang máy\nElevSen -up-&gt; Ard\nArd -down-&gt; ElevMotor\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="ETSnzLahC6dEKFg1kJ80-53">
